  "meta": {
    "title": "Unary addition: aⁱbʲcⁱ⁺ʲ",
    "blurb": "Every a and every b pushes an X; every c pops one. The c’s balance exactly when there are as many of them as a’s and b’s together — addition, done by stacking.",
